{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a fascinating journey through Russian culture with a game that will test your knowledge and erudition! In this game you will become a participant of a unique test covering the rich cultural heritage of Russia of different epochs - from ancient traditions to modern customs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each correct answer you get 1 point, but be careful: for a mistake you will also get 1 point. The game requires concentration and deep knowledge, because only the most worthy will be able to earn the highest title of connoisseur of Russian culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After passing the test you will be given a special title that will reflect your level of skill. Will you become a \u201cCourtier\u201d, \u201cHundreder\u201d, \u201cPrince\u201d or perhaps a \u201cVoivode\u201d? It all depends on your knowledge and determination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to take on the challenge and demonstrate your love for Russian culture? Then start the game right now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For maximum convenience you can expand the game into full screen mode by pressing F , and to return to windowed mode - just press W .</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"ROOKIE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729270/f384c922d1349512df03e67030d818de9b77f7ec.jpg"},{"name":"\u041c\u0415\u0414\u041d\u042b\u0419 \u0413\u0420\u0418\u0412\u0415\u041d\u041d\u0418\u041a","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729270/1b997fc7efa1dfbadb1a3e81591f1e6c7664eb13.jpg"},{"name":"\u0421\u0415\u0420\u0415\u0411\u0420\u042f\u041d\u042b\u0419 \u0414\u0412\u0410\u0422\u0426\u0410\u0422\u041d\u0418\u041a","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729270/961f0a8ac39631a845137983fd76397c517b8904.jpg"},{"name":"\u041f\u041e\u0417\u041e\u041b\u041e\u0427\u0415\u041d\u041d\u042b\u0419 \u0420\u0423\u0